# Discord RPC Configuration
# 1. Get your Discord User Token (NOT a bot token)
#    - Open Discord in a browser -> F12 -> Network -> filter by "/api"
#    - Click on a request and look for 'authorization' in Request Headers
# 2. Save this file as ~/.env (e.g., cp scripts/env.example ~/.env)
# 3. Paste your token below (quotes are optional)

TOKEN=your_discord_user_token_here
# TOKEN="your_discord_user_token_here"
